---
description: Mealie project rules
alwaysApply: true
---

Read `AGENTS.md` at the repository root before changing code. Key rules:

- Done means `task validate` exits 0 (enforced). `task security` is report-only; add no new findings.
- Frontend needs Node 24 (`mise exec node@24 -- <cmd>`). `unset VIRTUAL_ENV` before `uv`/`task`.
- `task ui:test` is watch mode; use `task ui:test:ci`.
- Do not edit generated files (`frontend/app/lib/api/types/`, `mealie/schema/*/__init__.py`); run `task dev:generate`.
- Only edit `en-US` locale files.
- Use OpenSpec for non-trivial changes (`/opsx-propose`, `/opsx-apply`, `/opsx-verify`, `/opsx-archive`).
- Agent docs live in `docs/agents/`.
